  \, "rdquo" -> Por Tu Amor" leading into her debut album The Death of Me\,
  out September 4th. Shimmering\, dancefloor ready\, and heavy with yearnin
 g\, the record moves through passion and rebirth in a world of nostalgic t
 enderness and dark glamour. HOLY WATER Jacob came up in the Punk / Hardcor
 e scene in Northern California. Jacob's band LONELY KINGS released 4 Full 
 length Records for FEARLESS RECORDS. Lonely Kings Extensively toured USA /
  EUROPE / UK with bands like AT THE DRIVE IN\, HOT WATER MUSIC\, THE MISFI
 TS\, AFI etc. HOLY WATER was established in 2018 after 12 years doing DJ g
 igs playing Indie Dance\, Tech House\, Industrial\, and Post Punk. HOLY WA
 TER is a combination of J
LOCATION:1535 Commercial Way\, Santa Cruz\, CA
